#### 8. `CategoryApplicationService` Uses Wrong TTL Property

- **Category**: Caching (Configuration)
- **File**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/application/index/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/application/index/service/proxy/CategoryApplicationService.kt:22`
- **Impact**: The local cache for categories is initialized with `localCacheProperties.brand.ttlSeconds` instead of `localCacheProperties.category.ttlSeconds`. This means the category cache TTL is 3600 seconds (1 hour, the brand TTL) instead of the intended 600 seconds (10 minutes). While not a performance degradation per se, it means category data is cached 6x longer than intended, which could serve stale data after category hierarchy changes.

