      if (unlinked.isNotEmpty()) pushTasks.add { legacySyncRepository.pushUnlinkedProducts(unlinked, op) }
      if (unlinkedDeletes.isNotEmpty()) pushTasks.add { legacySyncRepository.pushUnlinkedProductDeletes(unlinkedDeletes) }
      return pushTasks
  }
  ```

